  (text "HEAVY-LIFT UAV MAIN POWER PATH (48V BATTERY-ELECTRIC DC BUS)" (at 40 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold)))
  (text "1. BATTERY CHARGER SYSTEM\n- Output: Ground Balance Charger Port\n- Cable Rating: 48V_BUS, MAX 10A (Ground Charging Only)" (at 40 55 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
  (text "2. MAIN PROPULSION BATTERY & BMS\n- Battery: 12S Semi-Solid-State (44.4V Nominal, 520 Wh/kg)\n- Pack Capacity: 6,307.2 Wh (12.129 kg Pack Mass)\n- Cable Rating: BAT_BUS, MAX 100A continuous / 150A Peak" (at 85 115 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
  (text "3. MAIN POWER DISTRIBUTION BOARD (PDB)\n- Input: 48V DC Bus (Total Hover Power: 3,836.1 W @ 86.3A Total)\n- 6x ESC Branch Outputs: 48V DC, 14.4A Hover / 53.0A Peak per Branch" (at 175 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
  (text "AVIONICS & CONTROL SIGNAL ARCHITECTURE" (at 40 198 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold)))
  (text "1. FLIGHT CONTROLLER (Darkmatter BRAHMA F7)\n- PWM Outputs [PWM_1 .. PWM_6] -> 6x ESC Signal Inputs\n- Telemetry 1 -> ZeroDrag Nexus1 ELRS Link (2.4GHz)\n- GPS / RTK -> Elena Geo NDNU GPS/RTK Receiver (Serial GPS1)\n- CAN Bus [CAN1_H/L] -> BMS Telemetry, and GPS2\n- Companion Computer -> Ethernet MAVLink to Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano" (at 110 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
  (text "2. COMPANION COMPUTER\n- Model: Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano\n- High-level autonomy and payload interface\n- Powered by DC-DC 5V Regulator" (at 30 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
  (text "3. REGULATED RAIL OUTPUTS\n- REG1: 12V 10A Rail for Video Tx / Camera Gimbal\n- REG2: 5V 10A Rail for Flight Controller & Jetson Orin" (at 175 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
)